# Animation

- Cause → transition → result; no decorative loops.
- Prefer `transform` / `opacity`; honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Complex viz need play/pause/step/scrub (and speed when applicable).
- Captions must teach if motion is off.
- See `docs/animation-system.md` and skills `animation-engineering`, `educational-animation`.
